msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "???「HEEEY, TAKASU! AISAKA!」"
msgstr "???「¡EEEY, TAKASU! ¡AISAKA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Isn't that Kitamura-kun?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Ese no es Kitamura-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, there he is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, ahí está.」"

msgid "Kitamura「HEEEY!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡EEEY!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......OHH!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡OOOH!」"

msgid "Kitamura「'Sup, Takasu, Aisaka.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué tal, Takasu, Aisaka?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, are you training first thing in the＿new year?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿entrenando apenas＿empieza el año nuevo?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Well, nothing as serious as that, but my＿free time runs out tomorrow. I thought＿I'd do some running as a warmup.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bueno, nada tan serio, pero mi tiempo＿libre se acaba mañana. Pensé en salir＿a correr un poco para calentar.」"

msgid "Taiga「Wow, I should expect as much from the＿boys' softball captain.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vaya, no esperaba menos del capitán＿de sóftbol masculino.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Totally different from Taiga, who's just＿been lounging around this whole time.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Totalmente distinto a Taiga,＿que se ha pasado todo este＿tiempo holgazaneando.」"

msgid "Taiga「W-What the!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿P-Pero qué?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hahaha! Doing nothing for the holidays＿is appealing in its own way, though.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Jajaja! Aunque no hacer nada en＿vacaciones tiene su encanto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Uh, yeah, that's right!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eh, sí, ¡así es!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't compare yourself to someone＿who's busy year-round like Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te compares con alguien que está＿ocupado todo el año como Kitamura.」"

msgid "Taiga「Wha......! Wait, you remembered that＿too?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué......?! Espera, ¿también＿recordaste eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... Come to think of it, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Ahora que lo pienso, sí.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, seems your memories are steadily＿returning, hm? That's great to hear.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Vaya, parece que tus recuerdos vuelven＿poco a poco, ¿eh? Qué buena noticia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, well, little by little...... At the very＿least, I wanted to work on getting them＿back over winter break.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, bueno, poco a poco...... Al menos＿quería esforzarme por recuperarlos en＿las vacaciones de invierno.」"

msgid "Kitamura「I'd like it if there was a way for you to＿get them all back at once, though.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ojalá hubiera una forma de que los＿recuperaras todos de golpe.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sounds too good to be true.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Suena demasiado bueno para ser verdad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A trigger, huh......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Un detonante, ¿eh......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Maybe they'll all flood back once I beat＿you to a crimson pulp.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Quizá vuelvan de golpe cuando te muela＿a golpes hasta dejarte rojo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm against violence! Why are you＿always like this?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Estoy en contra de la violencia!＿¿Por qué siempre eres así?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Haha, that's just like you, Aisaka.＿Though, it might not be such a bad＿idea after all.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Jaja, típico de ti, Aisaka. Aunque＿puede que después de todo no＿sea tan mala idea.」"

msgid "Taiga「You think so too?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Tú también lo crees?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kitamura! What the hell are YOU＿suggesting!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡K-Kitamura! ¡¿Qué demonios＿estás sugiriendo TÚ?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Now hold on. I'm not saying we should＿beat you up on the spot. Not at all.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Calma, calma. No digo que debamos＿golpearte aquí mismo. Para nada.」"

msgid "Kitamura「The part that isn't bad is \"turning you＿crimson.\"」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Lo que no es mala idea＿es \"dejarte rojo\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Kitamura「How about we get your body working＿so hard that you get red in the face?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué tal si haces trabajar tu cuerpo＿hasta ponerte rojo del esfuerzo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Sports?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Deportes?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Precisely.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Exactamente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now I get it...... I haven't tried that yet.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya entiendo...... Aún no he probado eso.」"

msgid "Kitamura「If you happen to be free after this,＿would you care to stop by the batting＿center? I'll accompany you if you do.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Si estás libre después de esto,＿¿quieres pasar por el centro de＿bateo? Si vas, te acompaño.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's see. What should we do, Tai...... uh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A ver. ¿Qué hacemos, Tai...... eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Taiuh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Taieh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, well, errr...... My bad, Kitamura, I've＿got an errand to run after this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno, ehm...... Perdón, Kitamura,＿tengo un recado que hacer después.」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't have to worry about me, you＿know.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No tienes que preocuparte＿por mí, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, we haven't had lunch yet.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, aún no hemos almorzado.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Let's do it next time, then.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Hagámoslo la próxima vez, entonces.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro.」"

msgid "Kitamura「See you around.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Nos vemos luego.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, see ya.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, nos vemos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, bye-bye!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ah, adiós!」"

msgid "Taiga「......You should have gone with him.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Debiste haber ido con él.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah. Well...... No, it's fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No. Bueno...... No, así está bien.」"

msgid "Kitamura「No, didn't you know? You might not＿know the cause behind your amnesia,＿but if you were to determine it, it could」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No, ¿no lo sabías? Puede que no sepas＿la causa de tu amnesia, pero si la＿descubrieras, eso podría」"

msgid "Kitamura「trigger all your memories to return.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「detonar el regreso de＿todos tus recuerdos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I turned Kitamura down because I＿remembered what a demonic teacher＿he is...... It's probably best not to say）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Rechacé a Kitamura porque recordé＿lo demoníaco que es como＿instructor...... Mejor no decirle）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（that to Taiga......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（eso a Taiga......）」"
